{"title":"52 more things Kent Hendricks learned in 2024","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/910465292/0/marginalrevolution~more-things-Kent-Hendricks-learned-in.html","date":1736063935000,"content":"<blockquote><p>Indian Americans own about half of all motels in the United States. Of them, 70% have the last name Patel.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>And:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>In the 1990s, then-leader of North Korea, Kim Jong-ll, and current leader Kim Jong-Un got fake Brazilian passports and went to Disneyland in Tokyo (probably).</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>And:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>Waymo self-driving taxis generate 88% fewer property damage claims and 92% fewer bodily injury claims than human drivers. After driving 25.3 million miles, Waymo Driver had nine property damage claims and two injury claims, compared to 78 property damage claims and 26 injury claims from humans who drive an equivalent number of miles.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here are<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://kenthendricks.com/52-things-i-learned-in-2024/\" target=\"_blank\"> 49 more</a>, not all confirmed in the Andrew Gelman sense.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/52-more-things-kent-hendricks-learned-in-2024.html\">52 more things Kent Hendricks learned in 2024</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/910465292/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/910465292/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/910465292/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.